{# Section eyebrow: mono label preceded by a small square marker.
   Params: text, tone.

   The tone is not decoration. Papaya on a light ground measures 3.60:1 and
   misses AA, so type on light carries `accent-on-light`; on a dark ground the
   full brand color is the readable one and carries the label itself.

   The third tone belongs to the sibling brand, whose petrol has the mirror
   problem: it is readable on light and misses on dark. This tone is only
   ever used inside the dark cross-promo band, so it carries the brighter
   step for both the label and its marker. #}
{% set tone = tone|default('light') %}
{% if tone == 'krausgebaut' %}
    <p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-krausgebaut-on-dark">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-[2px] bg-brand-krausgebaut-on-dark"></span>{{ text }}
    </p>
{% else %}
    <p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] {{ tone == 'dark' ? 'text-accent-on-dark' : 'text-accent-on-light' }}">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-[2px] bg-accent"></span>{{ text }}
    </p>
{% endif %}
